  json: '{"Options":[{"Connections":[],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":300,"yPos":684},"ID":16,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"-<Continue>-","parentUIDs":[35],"SpeechUID":-1}],"Parameters":[],"SpeechNodes":[{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":19}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":true,"xPos":308.5,"yPos":22},"ID":0,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Wolf!
    Are you ok? I got worried for a bit there.","parentUIDs":[],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"V.I.R.U.S.","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":1},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":20}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":165,"yPos":123},"ID":19,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Crap...
    I got hit by a bot. It instantly got me out from its network.","parentUIDs":[0],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Wolf","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":1},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":21}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":441,"yPos":120},"ID":20,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Wait...
    Wolf, it looks you''ve got infected... cybernetically.","parentUIDs":[19],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"V.I.R.U.S.","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":1},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":22}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":163,"yPos":232},"ID":21,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"What?
    I feel totally fine. What you mean Vi? Is it that bad? Can you cure it?","parentUIDs":[20],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Wolf","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":1},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":23}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":442,"yPos":222},"ID":22,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"I
    don''t think so at the moment... but it''s mostly at your eyes, its like taking
    over your sight. Let me try to nullify it.","parentUIDs":[21],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"V.I.R.U.S.","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":1},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":25}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":161,"yPos":333},"ID":23,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"My
    eyes are getting itchy all of a sudden, I can''t stop rubbing it. This is getting
    irritating! ","parentUIDs":[22],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Wolf","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":1},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":26}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":159,"yPos":444},"ID":24,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Argh...
    It burns... Let me put an ice pack on it, it really stings.","parentUIDs":[25],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Wolf","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":1},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":24}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":444,"yPos":328},"ID":25,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Oh
    no, we are in deep trouble. The host may have installed a script injection in
    the bot infection and triggers when it is sabotaged. If I try to tinker it again,
    you will go blind.","parentUIDs":[23],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"V.I.R.U.S.","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":1},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":27}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":444,"yPos":436},"ID":26,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"I''m
    sorry, Wolf. I guess you''ll be temporarily blind for now. As soon as the host
    gets further from its bots, its effectiveness will be weaken. But we would need
    to wait for a few weeks and find the perfect time to decipher the infection.","parentUIDs":[24],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"V.I.R.U.S.","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":1},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":35}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":152,"yPos":549},"ID":27,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Alright.
    Since it can''t be helped for now... I''ll rest my eyes. Hopefully it won''t
    be much as painful.","parentUIDs":[26],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"Wolf","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":1},{"Connections":[{"__type":"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor","Conditions":[],"NodeUID":16}],"EditorInfo":{"isRoot":false,"xPos":439,"yPos":551},"ID":35,"ParamActions":[],"TMPFontGUID":null,"Text":"Sure.
    I''ll keep an eye and check some clues from our breach earlier. Now, get some
    rest.","parentUIDs":[27],"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically":false,"AudioGUID":null,"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption":false,"IconGUID":null,"Name":"V.I.R.U.S.","OptionUIDs":null,"SpeechUID":0,"TimeUntilAdvance":0,"Volume":1}]}'
